# Generated machine-specific artifacts produced by install.sh from the
# corresponding *.symlink templates. Examples:
#   zsh/.zshrc.local.symlink       <- sed-substituted from zsh/.zshrc.symlink
#                                     (replaces DOTFILES_ROOT with the absolute
#                                     path to this clone)
#   git/.gitconfig.local.symlink   <- sed-substituted from git/.gitconfig.symlink
#                                     (replaces AUTHOR / PERSONAL_EMAIL with
#                                     answers to install.sh prompts)
# They contain machine-specific paths and/or personal identity, so each clone
# regenerates its own copy. Never commit these. Re-run install.sh to recreate.
*.local.*
